{"version":1,"content":"<p>據科技媒體The Next Web當地時間11月27日報道，今年「黑五」成為AI購物代理迄今最大的一次考驗。Adobe數據顯示，感恩節當天AI服務為美國零售網站帶來的流量同比翻倍，線上消費額達到71億美元，同比增長10.4%；但AI代理完成的交易僅佔全球電商交易筆數的0.4%、金額的0.2%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588300.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.614041+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_hash":"7f384fa81295eda66a50e334e7f8210849db30affa4a16df5d46706f906059ec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}